<title>BRAZIL: Brazil shrs extend gains, up 6.3 pct in late trade.</title>
<headline>Brazil shrs extend gains, up 6.3 pct in late trade.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian stocks recouped some of Tuesday's crushing losses, shooting 6.25 percent higher in late afternoon trade in a technical correction, brokers said.</p>
<p>The Bovespa index  .BVSP of the 47 most traded stocks was up 726 points at 12,343 points at 1600 local time/1900 GMT, one hour before the market's close.</p>
<p>Turnover was 1.195 billion reais ($1.1 billion).</p>
</text>
